  "notes": "{流|なが}す means to cause something to flow, to wash away, or to broadcast.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {流|なが}れる (intransitive, to flow)\n\nMULTIPLE MEANINGS:\n1. Let flow: {涙|なみだ}を{流|なが}す (shed tears)\n2. Wash away: {水|みず}で{流|なが}す (rinse with water)\n3. Broadcast: {音楽|おんがく}を{流|なが}す (play music)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {涙|なみだ}を{流|なが}す: to shed tears\n- {汗|あせ}を{流|なが}す: to sweat (also figurative: work hard)\n- {血|ち}を{流|なが}す: to shed blood\n- トイレを{流|なが}す: to flush the toilet\n- ニュースを{流|なが}す: to broadcast news\n- {噂|うわさ}を{流|なが}す: to spread rumors",
